<title>CANADA: Canadian Gas Assoc storage survey - May 30.</title>
<headline>Canadian Gas Assoc storage survey - May 30.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Gas Association (CGA) weekly survey of Canadian natural gas in storage in billion cubic feet (bcf):</p>
<p>							 Pct Full  Pct Full</p>
<p>		 05/30/97  05/23/97  Pct Full  Week Ago  Year Ago</p>
<p>East	     34.84     28.17     15.0	12.1	15.6</p>
<p>West	     86.07     77.33     33.2	29.8	41.2</p>
<p>Total Canada  120.91    105.50     24.6	21.5	29.6</p>
<p>East-West division is the Manitoba/Saskatchewan and North Dakota/Minnesota borders.</p>
<p>East capacity 05/30/97: 232.55 bcf, 05/23/97: 232.55 bcf.</p>
</text>
